{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dv9MkBOwLo1793749517.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[16:30]</p><p>特朗普：願接受選舉結果，承認伊朗戰事影響選情，強調必要時行使總統否決權。</p><p></p><p>[12:38]</p><p>美國中期選舉，美國有線新聞網CNN推算民主黨奪回參、眾兩院控制權，意味總統特朗普成「跛腳鴨」政府。</p><p></p><p>[11:20]</p><p>美國中期選舉，美國有線新聞網CNN推算民主黨奪回眾議院控制權。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:45:40.866731+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:31.244235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:33.259328+00:00","content_hash":"7125ca4559996a43be0e768403622e3f6ef2f54a5f1b584343357e90fd256213","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}